# HealOS Agent Rules & Guidelines (.cursorrules)

## Architecture Overview
- HealOS is a decoupled Next.js (client) and Express.js + Socket.io (server) monorepo.
- The client uses Next.js App Router with TypeScript and Tailwind CSS.
- Adhere strictly to RFC 9728 (OAuth Protected Resource Metadata), RFC 9727 (API Catalog), and OpenAPI 3.1.0 specifications.

## Code Standards
- 0 ESLint errors allowed.
- 0 TypeScript compiler errors (`tsc --noEmit`).
- Keep shadscan audit score at 100/100 (Grade A).
- All API mutations must support idempotency via `Idempotency-Key` headers.
- Return typed RFC 7807 problem details for any non-2xx responses.

